  "notes": "Image is two zoomed insets plus a small overview of the whole board. Silkscreen-only labels used for the 5V/D-/D+/GND and GND/D3/D2/D0 pad rows. Skipped per rule 1: SPEAKER JST connector, PWR (12V) screw terminal (only '+' printed), AUDIO jack, BOOT/RST buttons. Square pads are not treated as pin-1 marks."
